// Written by hand using Sublime Text Distraction Free Mode, wifi off, on my Macbook Air M5, at Ho'Olana, at around 5:40am on Thursday November 5th, 2026. - Breck

I guess I should write a speech.

Or should I write a song?

What is a song but a speech with music?

I sit here at Turtle Bay, a place where I've enjoyed many many hours of great music with great people surrounded by great man made objects surrounded by far greater god made objects.

We are in a special place. We are in a special time.

But if you are in your 30's, the time is even more special. If you're in your 20's, it's even more special.

Calendar time is meaningless. The world's timeline is meaningless.

What year in civilization is it? Who cares. It doesn't matter.

What year in your life is it.

That's all that matters.

Life is precious.

Treasure everyday.

Tell people you love them.

Laugh.

Never get offended.

Be good with words but also good with your hands.

Be good to each other.

This is Launchation.

It's for you.

This is just the start of Knowbooks.

We did, actually, start the fire.

Well I mean, it has been always burning, but it did seem to be burning a little low.

Time to accelerate.

Not AIs.

But humans.

We are Knowbooks.
 https://knowbooks.com

We are hands.

We are vibes.

We are human.

Keep calm and copy on.

We love you.

A hui hou.

